# <%= it.title ?? "<Title>" %>

## Summary

- <One-to-three tight bullets stating the rule's essence; keep the block-id on the first.> ^summary

## Rule

<The rule, stated in one paragraph or a short imperative. Be specific
about what is required, forbidden, or expected.>

## Why

<Rationale. Why this rule exists; what failure mode it prevents or
what value it preserves. Link the Principles or Decisions that
motivated it.>

## How to apply

<Concrete guidance for authors, reviewers, and validators. How to
honor the rule in practice. Where applicable, name the validator that
checks it.>

## Anti-examples

<Concrete cases that violate the rule, and why each one violates it.
Delete if the rule is too abstract for anti-examples to add value.>

## Notes

<Caveats, references to related discussions, context that doesn't
fit elsewhere. Delete if there's nothing to add.>
